# D529 (mirrorstack-fleet#611): the paths only the owner or the security team merges. A PR that touches one
# needs a code-owner review from either (the org ruleset on the low-risk repos); any other path may be merged
# by the fleet's merge App after two fleet reviews. Kept equal to mirrorstack-fleet fleet/basic/merge.py
# OWNER_PATH (GitHub matches these with case; the fleet's own check is case-blind and also refuses such a PR).
/.github/              @I-am-nothing @mirrorstack-ai/security
migration              @I-am-nothing @mirrorstack-ai/security
migrations             @I-am-nothing @mirrorstack-ai/security
*.sql                  @I-am-nothing @mirrorstack-ai/security
iam/                   @I-am-nothing @mirrorstack-ai/security
security/              @I-am-nothing @mirrorstack-ai/security
CODEOWNERS             @I-am-nothing @mirrorstack-ai/security
*policy*.json          @I-am-nothing @mirrorstack-ai/security
**/internal/auth/      @I-am-nothing @mirrorstack-ai/security
**/internal/*/auth/    @I-am-nothing @mirrorstack-ai/security
